{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_225_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，薛伯定卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"二、夏，葬薛襄公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"三、叔孫州仇帥師墮郈。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"墮，猶取也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"四、衞公孟彄帥師伐曹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"五、季孫斯、仲孫何忌帥師墮費。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"六、秋，大雩。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，癸亥，公會齊侯盟於黃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"八、十有一月，丙寅，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"九、公至自黃。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，公圍成。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"非國言圍。圍成，大公也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"十一、公至自圍成。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_225_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_225","textTraditional":"何以致？危之也。何危爾？邊乎齊也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}